msgstr "Défilement auto"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1942
msgid "Debug Variation Attributes"
msgstr "Déboguer les attributs de variation"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1943
msgid ""
"If variations show \"Any Colour\" or \"Any Number of cups\" instead of real "
"values:"
msgstr ""
"Si les variations affichent \"Any Colour\" ou \"Any Number of cups\" au lieu "
"des valeurs réelles :"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1945
msgid "Add to wp-config.php:"
msgstr "Ajouter dans wp-config.php :"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1946
msgid "Run \"Sync Now\" from the dashboard."
msgstr "Exécutez \"Sync Now\" depuis le tableau de bord."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1947
